From f587285b158c709a35ab1603fceade2440755f58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nx2: L3-domain thread placement, pipeline worker cap,
 CPU-tuned Windows workflow

EDEN_NX2_PLACEMENT=gpu|split keeps the GPU front, GPUBack and VulkanWorker on one L3
domain (Zen 2 CCX) and, with split, the guest cores and background workers on the others.
EDEN_NX2_PIPELINE_WORKERS caps the pipeline builders. Both are off unless set.

lichii-tuned.yml builds the MinGW clang PGO binary with YUZU_BUILD_PRESET (default zen2),
with and without ThinLTO, as artifacts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
